    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d557">

                <pb facs="0525" n="513" sameAs="frus:frus1944v05/pg513"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">881.044/30: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Chargé at Tangier</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Childs</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-02-26T18:00:00-04:00">February 26,
                            1944—6 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>27. The Department approves, reference your airgram A–25, February 8, 6 p.m.,
                    extension of the requisition measures to olive crops of American <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ressortissants</hi> in French Morocco subject to the
                    reservations outlined in your airgram. In this connection see Algiers telegram
                    no. 490, February 15, 8 p.m. to the Department.</p>
                <p>Repeat to Algiers, Casablanca and Rabat.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stettinius</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
